 kê» = UNVERIFIED&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Trạng thái xác minh ngân hàng&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;status: TeacherRevenueWithdrawalStatus «kiểu liệt kê» = PENDING&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Trạng thái&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;note: String?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Ghi chú&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;transferTransactionCode: String?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Mã giao dịch chuyển khoản&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;[FK]&lt;/b&gt; processedById: String? → User.id&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Mã người xử lý&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;processedAt: DateTime?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Thời điểm xử lý&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;createdAt: DateTime = now()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Thời điểm tạo&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;updatedAt: DateTime · tự động cập nhật&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Thời điểm cập nhật&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;──────────────&lt;br/&gt;@@index([teacherId, createdAt]) · Chỉ mục&lt;br/&gt;@@index([status, createdAt]) · Chỉ mục" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#7d2623;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1215" width="515" height="612" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-commerce-table-TeacherRevenueWithdrawalComplaint" value="&lt;b&gt;TeacherRevenueWithdrawalComplaint — Khiếu nại rút doanh thu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;──────────────&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;[PK]&lt;/b&gt; id: String = uuid()&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Mã định danh&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;[FK,UQ]&lt;/b&gt; withdrawalId: String → TeacherRevenueWithdrawal.id&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Mã yêu cầu rút tiền&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;[FK]&lt;/b&gt; teacherId: String → User.id&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;↳ Mã giảng viên&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;